      "mergeID": "5ad99b2d4e2de47f49287ad7",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Would be awesome to be able to have a YouTube panel just for music, say it appears when you go to interact with a jukebox or radio or something, you type in the name of the song, pick the video you want, and only the audio streams. Would also be great for someone who wants to have a song or playlist from YouTube streaming in their world without having the YouTube panel up.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Music-Only YouTube Panels",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5a78909ab4e7a8489ff372d7",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Would be nice but also against YouTube ToS as they state anything with youtube must show the audio and video. Thats why a lot of apps won't work unless you have YouTube Red while its minimized.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
